Package: vworld.map
Type: Package
Title: VWorld StaticMap API 2.0 Client for R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Derick S.",
                  family = "Park",
                  email = "soonmai@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R client for the VWorld Open Platform StaticMap API 2.0
    (<https://api.vworld.kr/req/image>). Build static map image URLs or
    download map images directly, with full support for base maps
    (GRAPHIC / PHOTO / HYBRID / etc.), markers, routes, custom CRS, and
    overlay layers. Helpers are provided to embed VWorld static maps in
    'ggplot2' plots and to use them as a 'leaflet' tile / image overlay.
